OL,3,GNEWSADerry Halloween set for dazzling
OL,4,A40th anniversary finale
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people are set to
OL,7,Fenjoy the final day of the Halloween
OL,8,Ffestival in Londonderry, considered to
OL,9,Fbe the largest of its kind in Europe
OL,11,FThe climax is a parade through the city
OL,12,Fcentre followed by a spectacular
OL,13,Ffireworks display on the riverfront
OL,15,FPeople from all over the world are in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland's second city for the
OL,17,Fconclusion of the four-day carnival,
OL,18,Fwhich is marking its 40th anniversary
